        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for lod stripe/desc helpers",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 lod: add kunit test for lod stripe/desc helpers\n\nExport lod_adjust_stripe_size(), lod_comp_entry_stripe_count(),\nlod_comp_md_size(), lod_fix_desc_stripe_size(),\nlod_fix_desc_stripe_count(), lod_fix_desc_pattern(),\nlod_fix_lmv_desc_pattern(), lod_fix_desc_qos_maxage() and\nlod_fix_desc() for direct testing.\n\nAdd lustre/kunit/lod_misc_test.c, covering small LOD helpers that\nvalidate/fix up striping parameters and compute on-disk sizes on\nplain structs, with no dt_object/OST/thandle involved:\nlod_fix_desc_stripe_size/count/pattern(), lod_fix_lmv_desc_pattern(),\nlod_fix_desc_qos_maxage() and lod_fix_desc() clamping an out-of-range\nor zero lov_desc/lmv_desc field to a sane default; lod_adjust_\nstripe_size() picking a stripe size for a component when none was\nset, or fixing one up if it does not divide the component's end;\nlod_comp_entry_stripe_count() reading back an inited component's\nstripe count as-is, or asking lod_get_stripe_count{,_plain}() to\nresolve LOV_ALL_STRIPES* or 0; and lod_comp_md_size() summing up the\non-disk LOV EA size of a (composite or plain) layout's components.\n\nTest-Parameters: ignore\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: AGENT:claude-sonnet-5\nChange-Id: If24c881a6867801e6c4fe600e960454eef5bc630\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
